{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Atsuko": 30,
    "Michiru": 20,
    "Paimon": 3,
    "Player": 23,
    "Yoh": 31
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7280201",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Atsuko",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728020101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728020101": {
            "id": "728020101",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "I wonder how mom is doing, and dad as well...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020102"
            ]
          },
          "728020102": {
            "id": "728020102",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "Oh? Traveler? What are you doing here? I remember you asked me how to go to Inazuma last time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020103"
            ]
          },
          "728020103": {
            "id": "728020103",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I've been to Inazuma.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020104"
            ]
          },
          "728020104": {
            "id": "728020104",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "You did go. And you managed to come back...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020105"
            ]
          },
          "728020105": {
            "id": "728020105",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "You live up to your reputation as a warrior. Your abilities are far beyond those of ordinary folks like me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020106"
            ]
          },
          "728020106": {
            "id": "728020106",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "Oh right! If you don't mind, can you do me a favor?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020109"
            ]
          },
          "728020109": {
            "id": "728020109",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "When I left Inazuma, I left without saying goodbye.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020110"
            ]
          },
          "728020110": {
            "id": "728020110",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "Ever since I was little, I've longed for the world outside of Inazuma. I liked to travel and I disliked being controlled by my parents.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020111"
            ]
          },
          "728020111": {
            "id": "728020111",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "After they issued the Vision Hunt Decree, the atmosphere in Inazuma has become increasingly suffocating. That's why I decided to leave my hometown.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020112"
            ]
          },
          "728020112": {
            "id": "728020112",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "When I came to Liyue, although I managed to find a way to survive. I couldn't find a reliable person to send a message to my family back home.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020113"
            ]
          },
          "728020113": {
            "id": "728020113",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "Can I ask you for a favor to help deliver a letter to my parents?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7280202",
      "subQuestName": "Give the letter to Michiru and Yoh",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728020201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728020201": {
            "id": "728020201",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "How many dishes should we make for lunch tomorrow?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020202"
            ]
          },
          "728020202": {
            "id": "728020202",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "Our kids can eat a lot these days. Let's just cook more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020203"
            ]
          },
          "728020203": {
            "id": "728020203",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "Hmm? Who might you be...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020206"
            ]
          },
          "728020206": {
            "id": "728020206",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "Yes, we are. What can I do for you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020207"
            ]
          },
          "728020207": {
            "id": "728020207",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Atsuko asked me to bring you this letter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020208"
            ]
          },
          "728020208": {
            "id": "728020208",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "Letter? Why would that child suddenly want to write a letter to us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020209"
            ]
          },
          "728020209": {
            "id": "728020209",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "The letter is quite long... I mean, she's back at home already, so if she wants to say something, she should just say it to us directly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7280203",
      "subQuestName": "Wait until the following night (18:00 – 6:00)",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728020301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728020301": {
            "id": "728020301",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "Why is our daughter back before the date of signature on this letter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020302"
            ]
          },
          "728020302": {
            "id": "728020302",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "Let's not overthink things. It's probably a misunderstanding. It'll be more helpful if you can help me figure out what to make for lunch tomorrow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7280204",
      "subQuestName": "Wait until nighttime (18:00 – 6:00)",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728020401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728020401": {
            "id": "728020401",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "Atsuko hasn't returned yet. Please come back in the evening.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020402"
            ]
          },
          "728020402": {
            "id": "728020402",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "If you wait until the evening, then Atsuko should be back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7280205",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Atsuko's house",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728020501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728020501": {
            "id": "728020501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Atsuko should be back now. Let's knock on the door.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020502"
            ]
          },
          "728020502": {
            "id": "728020502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "They seem to be talking about something.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020503"
            ]
          },
          "728020503": {
            "id": "728020503",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "That being said, I wonder what happened to the Tanuki that we rescued before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020504"
            ]
          },
          "728020504": {
            "id": "728020504",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "You're too kind. That Tanuki only had a minor scrape on its leg. If you let it be in the bushes, it would've recovered by itself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020505"
            ]
          },
          "728020505": {
            "id": "728020505",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "I couldn't help it. It was looking at me with tears in its eyes. It looked very pitiful. My conscience just wouldn't let me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020506"
            ]
          },
          "728020506": {
            "id": "728020506",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "Forget it. It's never wrong to do good deeds. It's just that it ate a bit too much, nearly as much as me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020507"
            ]
          },
          "728020507": {
            "id": "728020507",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Knocking on the door",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020508"
            ]
          },
          "728020508": {
            "id": "728020508",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "Who is it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020509"
            ]
          },
          "728020509": {
            "id": "728020509",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm the Traveler that came here before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020510"
            ]
          },
          "728020510": {
            "id": "728020510",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "Ahh, I remember you. Please wait here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020511"
            ]
          },
          "728020511": {
            "id": "728020511",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "He—Hello! I'm Atsuko, first... no... nice to see you again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020512"
            ]
          },
          "728020512": {
            "id": "728020512",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "Sorry, I was homesick. After I gave you the letter, I changed my mind and took a ship back to Inazuma.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020513"
            ]
          },
          "728020513": {
            "id": "728020513",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "Ahaha... Sorry for not clarifying things before, and making you travel so far.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020514"
            ]
          },
          "728020514": {
            "id": "728020514",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How did you return to Inazuma?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020515"
            ]
          },
          "728020515": {
            "id": "728020515",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "...Ah, I had my ways, haha. You don't have to worry about that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020516"
            ]
          },
          "728020516": {
            "id": "728020516",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "Um, I've prepared the payment for you. Please take it. Thanks for your help. Hurry... uh, hurry up and go about the rest of your day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020517"
            ]
          },
          "728020517": {
            "id": "728020517",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How come the things that Atsuko are telling us now are different from what it was before? If returning to Inazuma was so easy, why did you ask us for help in the first place?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020519",
              "728020521"
            ]
          },
          "728020519": {
            "id": "728020519",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "Business? What business? I had a business in Liyue!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020522"
            ]
          },
          "728020522": {
            "id": "728020522",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "...Ah, that kind of stuff is unimportant. Nothing is more important than family. I already entrusted it all to someone else, ah... haha.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020523"
            ]
          },
          "728020523": {
            "id": "728020523",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hang on! The real Atsuko had trouble finding a job in Liyue, there's no way that she'd suddenly become rich!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020524"
            ]
          },
          "728020524": {
            "id": "728020524",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Who are you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020525"
            ]
          },
          "728020525": {
            "id": "728020525",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "I—I'm Atsuko, of course! I look like Atsuko and sound like Atsuko. What's there to be suspicious about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020526"
            ]
          },
          "728020526": {
            "id": "728020526",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "Look here! Stop being so persistent... forget it. I won't talk to you anymore. I've got work tomorrow. I'm heading off now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020527"
            ]
          },
          "728020527": {
            "id": "728020527",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "Atsuko! That child... Why did she get angry all of a sudden...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020528"
            ]
          },
          "728020528": {
            "id": "728020528",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "Sorry about that, Traveler. That child must be too tired from her work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020529"
            ]
          },
          "728020529": {
            "id": "728020529",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "But you saw her for yourselves. That's our daughter. That letter... Maybe that child forgot about it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020530"
            ]
          },
          "728020530": {
            "id": "728020530",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "But in any case, we'd still like to thank you for the trouble you went through. As for the payment... Would you be able to wait a little longer?"
          },
          "728020521": {
            "id": "728020521",
            "speakerId": 20307,
            "speakerName": "Atsuko",
            "text": "Mansion? What? I even had a mansion in Liyue!?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7280206",
      "subQuestName": "Wait until the following day",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728020601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728020601": {
            "id": "728020601",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "Where did our daughter run off to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020604"
            ]
          },
          "728020604": {
            "id": "728020604",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "Even if she's working the next day, Atsuko usually says something to us before leaving. But today, she left without saying anything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020605"
            ]
          },
          "728020605": {
            "id": "728020605",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "After you left yesterday, Atsuko said she was tired and went straight to her room to sleep.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020606"
            ]
          },
          "728020606": {
            "id": "728020606",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "By the time we got up the next day, she wasn't in bed anymore.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020607"
            ]
          },
          "728020607": {
            "id": "728020607",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "We tried looking everywhere for her. My husband searched far and wide.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020608"
            ]
          },
          "728020608": {
            "id": "728020608",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "However, even after half a day, we still couldn't find any traces of our daughter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020609"
            ]
          },
          "728020609": {
            "id": "728020609",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "*sigh* Did that child go off on another journey again? What a troublesome child...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020610"
            ]
          },
          "728020610": {
            "id": "728020610",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "Calm down, dear. I'll look for her again. Please sweep Atsuko's room first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020611"
            ]
          },
          "728020611": {
            "id": "728020611",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "After that child left, she didn't close the window properly. A lot of leaves blew into the room.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020612"
            ]
          },
          "728020612": {
            "id": "728020612",
            "speakerId": 3050,
            "speakerName": "Yoh",
            "text": "Before I forget. Here's the payment. Please take it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728020613"
            ]
          },
          "728020613": {
            "id": "728020613",
            "speakerId": 3049,
            "speakerName": "Michiru",
            "text": "*sigh* That child, Atsuko... Where is she off to this time..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7280207",
